<title>USA: Patent suit filed against US Robotics, IBM.</title>
<headline>Patent suit filed against US Robotics, IBM.</headline>
<dateline>MONSEY, N.Y. 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Patent Corp International Friday said it has named International Business Machines Corp and U.S. Robotics Corp in a patent infringement suit seeking to enforce four of its patents.</p>
<p>It said the patents cover specific aspects of PC card modems and other computer communications devices.</p>
<p>General Patent said that it hopes that the infringing companies will respect the patents and license the technology without litigation.</p>
<p>Neither IBM nor U.S. Robotics was immediately available to comment on the suit.</p>
</text>
